OL,3,GNEWSADrug drones and violence persist
OL,4,Aat 'unsafe' prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FIssues with high levels of violence and
OL,7,Fthe delivery of illegal drugs by drone
OL,8,Fpersist at an "unsafe" men's prison, a
OL,9,Fprison watchdog has found.
OL,11,FThe Independent Monitoring Board (IMB)
OL,12,Fsaid it had observed "some continuing
OL,13,Fand worrying trends" at HMP Bullingdon,
OL,14,Fnear Bicester in Oxfordshire.
OL,16,FIn its yearly report on the prison, the
OL,17,FIMB found that illegal drones were
OL,18,Fstill being used to deliver "high
OL,19,Flevels of illicit items", whilst
OL,20,Fovercrowding was also a continuing
OL,21,Fissue.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
