OL,3,GNEWSADrug drones and violence persist
OL,4,Aat 'unsafe' prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ministry of Justice (MoJ)
OL,7,Fspokesperson said former Home Secretary
OL,8,FAmber Rudd was leading an independent
OL,9,Freview to "help deliver safer prisons,
OL,10,Fprotect the public and reduce
OL,11,Freoffending".
